{
    "title": "GPS Speedometer",
    "description": "GPS speedometer is beautifully designed speedometer. With analog and digital speedometers and a combination of both. \r\nHighly accurate as it relies completely on GPS signal. GPS speed is very accurate on higher speeds and can be more accurate than you car speedometer, since car manufacturers tend to modify their speedometers to report higher speeds than in reality.\r\n\r\nThe speedometer is practical for various reasons:\r\n - If your car has a faulty or an inaccurate speedometer, so it can save you speeding tickets.\r\n - If your driving a vehicle that is not equipped with a speedometer, like go carts, golf carts ... etc.\r\n - If you are riding a bicycle and you don't have physical tracker.\r\n - You can use that to know how fast is your kid school bus driver is going.\r\n - You want to track you trips. This speedometer can log them for you and show them on the map as well with relevant statistics about the trip, like distance, duration, average speed and top speed.\r\n\r\nThe speedometer comes with many extra features:\r\n - Speed limit alarm with sound and visuals, to warn you if you have gone above a certain speed you set.\r\n - HUD mode like in luxury cars, so you can reflect the speedometer on the windshield on focus on the road at night.\r\n - Select between multiple dashboards themed to resemble famous super cars, luxury cars and futuristic speedometers.\r\n - Change colors of the speedometer to whatever matches your vehicle from a list of attractive colors.\r\n - An odometer to track the total distance you travelled with your vehicle. You can also set the odometer value manually, so you can match the odometer reading of your vehicle.\r\n - Trip log for tracking your trips and valuable statistics about them. Which you can use to analyze your driving habits and routes.\r\n - Ease of switching speedometer themes just by swiping left and right on the screen.",
    "descriptionHTML": "GPS speedometer is beautifully designed speedometer. With analog and digital speedometers and a combination of both. <br>Highly accurate as it relies completely on GPS signal. GPS speed is very accurate on higher speeds and can be more accurate than you car speedometer, since car manufacturers tend to modify their speedometers to report higher speeds than in reality.<br><br>The speedometer is practical for various reasons:<br> - If your car has a faulty or an inaccurate speedometer, so it can save you speeding tickets.<br> - If your driving a vehicle that is not equipped with a speedometer, like go carts, golf carts ... etc.<br> - If you are riding a bicycle and you don&#39;t have physical tracker.<br> - You can use that to know how fast is your kid school bus driver is going.<br> - You want to track you trips. This speedometer can log them for you and show them on the map as well with relevant statistics about the trip, like distance, duration, average speed and top speed.<br><br>The speedometer comes with many extra features:<br> - Speed limit alarm with sound and visuals, to warn you if you have gone above a certain speed you set.<br> - HUD mode like in luxury cars, so you can reflect the speedometer on the windshield on focus on the road at night.<br> - Select between multiple dashboards themed to resemble famous super cars, luxury cars and futuristic speedometers.<br> - Change colors of the speedometer to whatever matches your vehicle from a list of attractive colors.<br> - An odometer to track the total distance you travelled with your vehicle. You can also set the odometer value manually, so you can match the odometer reading of your vehicle.<br> - Trip log for tracking your trips and valuable statistics about them. Which you can use to analyze your driving habits and routes.<br> - Ease of switching speedometer themes just by swiping left and right on the screen.",
